From: BeagleY AI integration <noreply@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] imaging: support the 20-region OX03H10 RGB2RGB profile

The OX03H10 DCC 304 RGB-to-RGB component has 20 regions. Increase the
generic parser limit and the RGB-to-RGB storage arrays on both the host
and remote firmware builds. Reject an oversized profile before parsing
component data so a future DCC cannot silently corrupt adjacent fields.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [BeagleY camera tuning]

--- a/imaging/algos/dcc/include/dcc_defs.h
+++ b/imaging/algos/dcc/include/dcc_defs.h
@@ -60,5 +60,5 @@
 /* This should be the max of all photospace instance */
-#define DCC_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST                (10U)
+#define DCC_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST                (20U)
 
 //
 //  Following enumerated list represents main component/sub-component/algorithm IDs.
--- a/imaging/algos/dcc/include/idcc.h
+++ b/imaging/algos/dcc/include/idcc.h
@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@
 
 /*---------------------- data declarations -----------------------------------*/
 
-#define DCC_RGB2RGB1_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST       (10U)
+#define DCC_RGB2RGB1_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST       (20U)
 #define DCC_NSF4V_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST          (10U)
 #define DCC_YEE_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST            (10U)
 #define DCC_DPC_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST            (10U)
--- a/imaging/algos/dcc/src/parse_data.c
+++ b/imaging/algos/dcc/src/parse_data.c
@@ -815,6 +815,13 @@
 
         p_bin = dcc_ptrs->p_parpack;
 
+        if (dcc_ptrs->num_regions > DCC_RGB2RGB1_MAX_PHOTO_SPACE_INST)
+        {
+            Trace_printf("ipipe_rgb2rgb_dcc_bin_parse : too many regions: %u\n",
+                         dcc_ptrs->num_regions);
+            return (-1);
+        }
+
